      "content": "Wait, stop the transition. I just got an updated packet from the solar monitoring station. The flare intensity is projecting significantly higher than the initial estimate. There's a possibility of a sudden ionospheric disturbance that could disrupt the solar panels.\n\nActually, re-evaluating the sensor data locally—it looks like the telemetry might be slightly lagged. Can you run a quick, high-compute simulation of the incoming flux against our current shielding to be 100% sure about the hardware risk? We need to be certain before we commit to the low-power state.",
